    "text": "<p>If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> is differentiable everywhere,</p>\r\r<p>then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to</p>\r"
  },
